<title>ITALY: Continental Cargo appoints Italian gsa.</title>
<headline>Continental Cargo appoints Italian gsa.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Tourist Representative(I.T.R. Srl) has been appointed as the cargo general sales agent for Continental Cargo from June 1st I.T.R Srl said in a statement. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
